    "body": "During the WHATWG Triage Session at TPAC today, WHATWG has resolved that `<dialog>` will dispatch a cancelable `beforetoggle` event during open and non-cancelable during close, and non-cancelable `toggle` event an async tick after; similarly to how `popover` (and soon to be `<details>` - see #9743) will.",
