    "body": "Yes, `showModal()` opens the dialog as a modal (blocks interaction with the document), `show()` does not:\r\n\r\n> The showModal() method of the HTMLDialogElement interface displays the dialog as a modal. \r\n> [MDN](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLDialogElement/showModal)",
