    "created_at": "2024-09-26T18:41:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-09-26T18:41:46Z",
    "body": "The difference will be that `event.target.matches(':modal')` will be true for `toggle` when calling `showModal()` and `beforetoggle` when calling `.close()` on a `:modal`.\r\n\r\nThere will be a limitation that `beforetoggle` when opening a dialog as either `show()`/`showModal()` will be indistuingishable, and `toggle` will be indistinguishable when a dialog has closed.",
